  "releaseNotes": "🌺 v0.2.2-alpha - Patch Release\n\n✨ New in this version:\n- Fixed tag/commit mismatch from v0.2.1-alpha release\n- CI/CD now builds from the correct tagged commit\n- Complete test suite with 137 passing tests\n- SkiaSharp native dependencies properly configured for Linux\n\n⚠️ This is an alpha version for testing and feedback.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fluent API for PDF generation\n- Support for sections, paragraphs, tables, and lists\n- Modern tropical-themed styling\n- Cross-platform support (.NET 9)\n- SkiaSharp-based rendering\n\n🐛 Known Issues:\n- Some advanced features may have rough edges\n- Documentation is still being expanded\n- Breaking changes may occur in future versions\n\n📝 Feedback: https://github.com/diegorenatob/AlohaPDF/issues",
